l take care of those weapons. Will that be alright, Commander?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah, I'll leave it to you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Khaybar salutes, then turns to leave. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, a strange awkwardness lingers inside the safe house. RO and the other Dolls crowd nervously around the bed, watching the still-unconscious M4 uneasily."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why are you all so tense, anyway?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M16 sits in the corner of the room, looking very relaxed."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...M4 hasn't woken up yet and you're asking us why we're tense?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"16! When will M4 wake up?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Do you really think that's M4?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What do you mean?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M16 opens a pack of compact food and munches on them as she looks up at ST AR-15."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I understand that you're concerned about her, but don't let your feelings overrule your rationality."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She isn't M4 at all."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, 16, I don't think you know, but! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She may look like someone else, but she's really M4 on the inside!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, she's not... At least, she's not the one we're looking for. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She IS M4, but at the same time she isn't."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What does that mean?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Exactly what I said."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And how do you know that?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've spent a long time searching for M4... Longer than you can imagine. I can tell the difference, but actually explaining it is a bit of a pain. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"More importantly, you ought to think about how to deal with that woman."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They're both matters of great concern to us. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'll deal with Morridow—I don't need or expect to gain any more information from her. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As for M4... No matter what you might think, she's still part of the team, and a member of the AR Team."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You haven't changed a bit, Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Are you really not going to rejoin the AR Team? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Everyone here is willing to accept you. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We'd welcome you back."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, at least one person wouldn't."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Who?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Myself."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M16 stretches her legs, then gets up from her chair and dusts herself off."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Aw, don't look so sad. I told you, didn't I? For the time being, I'm at your disposal."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What does that mean?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I'll have to go sooner or later."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I came to Berlin with a mission of my own. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'll stick with you until I receive further orders. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"On the flip side, it means I'll leave once there's progress on my mission."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I see."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Beep beep beep."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sorry to interrupt your conversation, but this is urgent—we've got news."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What news?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We just got word from Agent J."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"J?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's a set of coordinates."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Have you checked them?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's a plant on the outskirts of Berlin. Classified stuff, unauthorized personnel are strictly forbidden to enter, that sort of thing."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Yet another Paradeus den."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"J claims that this place was very important, but he's been suspended from duty and he's having trouble slipping his minder. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"He arranged to meet us there."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I see. Got it."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, let's move out. The mission isn't over yet."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG_Inner","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_keyboardtype_sci","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Inside the command center in the heart of the base, Carter is sitting at a desk and adjusting the frequencies on a radio."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Yegor","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Adjutant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"General Carter..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The adjutant can't resist the urge to speak up as he watches Carter's unhurried movements from beside him."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Yegor","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Adjutant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are we really going to do this?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are you scared, adjutant?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Yegor","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Adjutant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, of course not. However, I do not understand the rationale behind this course of action. Are we really going to work together with those people?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After ensuring the channel is correct, Carter leans back in his chair and interlaces his fingers."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The basis of cooperation is mutual trust and mutual aid. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If need be, anyone can be our friend. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is a necessary sacrifice for the resurrection of our Motherland."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Yegor","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Adjutant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Yes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Is the \"Patriot\" ready?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Subordinate","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ready and waiting."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Carter peers at the list of names on the desk with narrowed eyes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Our friend... He is a dangerous politician. He will sell anything for the right price. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...But he is exactly like us in one regard."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"He loves his country dearly."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
